  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oil in a deep frying pan to 350°F (180°C).",
    "In a bowl, mix feta cheese and greek yogurt until well combined.",
    "Add mellow flour to the bowl and mix until a dough forms.",
    "Split the dough into 8-10 equal pieces.",
    "Shape each piece into a ball and flatten slightly.",
    "Coat each ball with crispy sesame seeds.",
